    "title": "Sunrun",
    "description": "Newly designed and easy-to-use, our app is the single access point for Sunrun customers to monitor their systems, track energy production, pay bills, and get the support they need.\r\n\r\nFeaturing: \r\n\u2022        Streamlined access to manage and organize all of your system data. Our user-friendly interface provides a centralized hub where you can conveniently access and oversee your system data. \r\n\u2022        Easy account management and bill payment options. You can access comprehensive billing reports, monitor payment history, and set up automated payments for peace of mind. \r\n\u2022        Thorough support page to help you find the answers you need. Whether it\u2019s getting started with your new system or questions around the fundamentals of solar, we\u2019ve got you're covered. \r\n\u2022        Contextualized insights to better understand the positive environmental impact you\u2019re making. Our app utilizes your system data to offer valuable insights, deepening your understanding of how your choices contribute to a greener planet.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Newly designed and easy-to-use, our app is the single access point for Sunrun customers to monitor their systems, track energy production, pay bills, and get the support they need.<br><br>Featuring: <br>\u2022        Streamlined access to manage and organize all of your system data. Our user-friendly interface provides a centralized hub where you can conveniently access and oversee your system data. <br>\u2022        Easy account management and bill payment options. You can access comprehensive billing reports, monitor payment history, and set up automated payments for peace of mind. <br>\u2022        Thorough support page to help you find the answers you need. Whether it\u2019s getting started with your new system or questions around the fundamentals of solar, we\u2019ve got you&#39;re covered. <br>\u2022        Contextualized insights to better understand the positive environmental impact you\u2019re making. Our app utilizes your system data to offer valuable insights, deepening your understanding of how your choices contribute to a greener planet.",
